300 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 75 0 R/E(May and June 2026 were unusually active months for the Department of Industrial Engineering & Management \(IEM\) at RV College of Engineering. During this period, faculty members delivered invited talks at leadership workshops, served on external evaluation juries, completed international training programmes, and hosted a visiting Associate Dean from the United States for an intensive certification course. Students were equally active, winning a start-up pitch competition, engaging with an internationally renowned Harvard Business School professor, and attending an expert lecture on entrepreneurship in the age of AI.)/Pg 17 0 R/K[13]>>
