643 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 86 0 R/E( showing how loneliness and the absence of a supportive environment can lead to severe emotional distress and thoughts of self-harm. Through a powerful blend of storytelling, emotion, and meaningful performances, Crushed took the audience through a range of emotions while encouraging them to reflect on the struggles that may remain hidden behind a person\220s outward appearance. Sapna\220s direction brought sensitivity and depth to the subject, leaving the audience with a strong message about empathy, compassion, understanding, and the importance of supporting one another.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

